      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A novel domino oxidative annulation of 2-vinylanilines with internal alkynes was developed to constitute a rare class of cyclopentaquinoline derivatives. This transformation encompasses four σ bonds formation, one quaternary carbon center construction, and pyridination steps in one pot under identical conditions, which fascinatingly increases the molecular complexity from easily available starting materials."},
